{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And He will make heard.</b> The majesty of His voice, so that the hearer is frightened by the sound of thunder." "<b>And descending.</b> A descent, like ותנחת עלי דרך (Psalms 38:3)." "<b>He will be seen.</b> Forever." "The bet of <b>בזעף</b> is attached after." "<b>בנפץ</b> from the root of תנפצם (Psalms 2:9)." "<b>And a stone of hail.</b> By way of parable."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:08.826179941Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}